sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as AppNavigation
    participant Auth as AuthRepository
    participant Firebase as Firebase Auth
    participant Firestore as FirestoreClient
    participant OVM as OnboardingViewModel
    participant Dashboard as DashboardScreen
    participant Scan as ScanScreen
    participant VM as ScanViewModel
    participant Parser as NutritionParser
    participant Analyzer as DietAnalyzer
    participant AI as GeminiClient

    Note over User,App: App Launch
    User->>App: Open app
    App->>Auth: check currentUser
    alt Already logged in
        App->>Dashboard: navigate to dashboard
    else Not logged in
        App->>App: navigate to welcome
    end

    Note over User,Firestore: Registration & Onboarding
    User->>App: Register (email, password)
    App->>Auth: register(email, password)
    Auth->>Firebase: createUserWithEmailAndPassword()
    Firebase-->>Auth: UID
    App->>Firestore: insertUser(User)
    App->>App: navigate to onboarding_path (nested nav)

    Note over User,OVM: Onboarding (3-step shared ViewModel)
    User->>OVM: enter age, weight, unit, activityLevel (OnboardingScreen)
    App->>App: navigate to GoalsScreen
    User->>OVM: toggleGoal() (GoalsScreen)
    App->>App: navigate to DietaryScreen
    User->>OVM: toggleAllergen(), toggleDiet() (DietaryScreen)
    OVM->>OVM: buildDietary(userId)
    DietaryScreen->>Firestore: insertDietary(Dietary)
    App->>Dashboard: navigate to dashboard

    Note over User,Firestore: Dashboard Load
    Dashboard->>Firestore: getWeeklyLogs(userId)
    Firestore-->>Dashboard: List~NutritionLog~ (pantry / weekly history)
    Dashboard->>Firestore: getDailyLogs(userId, startOfToday, endOfToday)
    Firestore-->>Dashboard: today's logs
    Dashboard->>Firestore: getDailyLogs(userId, startOfYesterday, endOfYesterday)
    Firestore-->>Dashboard: yesterday's logs
    Dashboard-->>User: show pantry + stat cards with real data

    Note over User,AI: Scanning a Label
    User->>Dashboard: tap camera FAB
    Dashboard->>Scan: navigate to scan
    Scan->>VM: initialize ScanViewModel (via ScanViewModelFactory)
    VM->>Firestore: getDietaryByUserId(userId)
    Firestore-->>VM: Dietary (allergens, goals, diets extracted)
    User->>Scan: point camera at label, tap Scan
    VM->>VM: captureAndScan()
    VM->>Parser: parse(rawText)
    Parser-->>VM: NutritionLabel? (null → show Error state)
    VM->>Analyzer: analyze(label, placeholderGoals, userAllergens)
    Analyzer-->>VM: FitResult (fitsInDiet, allergenWarnings)
    VM-->>Scan: ScanUiState.Results (label, fitResult, aiOverview="")
    Scan-->>User: show nutrition results immediately
    VM->>AI: getNutritionOverview(label, goals, allergens, diets)
    AI-->>VM: 2-3 sentence plain-text overview
    VM-->>Scan: ScanUiState.Results updated with aiOverview
    Scan-->>User: AI overview text appears

    Note over User,Firestore: Saving to Pantry
    User->>Scan: type product name, tap Save to Pantry
    Scan->>VM: saveLog(label, productName)
    VM->>Firestore: insertNutritionLog(NutritionLog)
    Firestore-->>VM: success
    User->>Scan: tap back
    Scan->>Dashboard: popBackStack
    Dashboard->>Firestore: snapshot listener updates automatically
    Dashboard-->>User: pantry updated with new item
